{"id":60837,"date":"2026-08-20T16:15:21","date_gmt":"2026-08-20T15:15:21","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-29T11:02:05","modified_gmt":"2026-09-29T10:02:05","slug":"meia-maratona-douro-vinhateiro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-douro-vinhateiro\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona Douro Vinhateiro (R\u00e9gua) 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona Douro Vinhateiro (R\u00e9gua) 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona do Douro Vinhateiro 2027<\/strong> (20\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o comemorativa) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>30 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, celebrando duas d\u00e9cadas da emblem\u00e1tica prova conhecida como &#8220;A Mais Bela Corrida do Mundo&#8221;. Com partida na Barragem de Baga\u00faste e chegada na Avenida do Douro, no <strong>Peso da R\u00e9gua<\/strong>, o evento percorre a paisagem \u00fanica do Alto Douro Vinhateiro, classificada como Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa oficial integra a <strong>Meia Maratona de 21,097 km<\/strong> (com classifica\u00e7\u00e3o pr\u00f3pria para atletas em cadeira de rodas) e a participativa <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> em formato solid\u00e1rio. Os participantes contam com transporte assegurado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 \u00e0 zona de partida, abastecimentos regulares, camisola t\u00e9cnica oficial, medalha comemorativa de finalista e anima\u00e7\u00e3o ao longo das margens do Rio Douro.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">30 de Maio de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255